data: {"id": "d28e645b7585461d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2586", "run_id": "d28e645b7585461d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，所有工具调用已完成。让我总结已采集的事实：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### Pod 身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2`\n- **UID**: `80b1ae6c-962d-4773-a9d0-195b269bb457`\n- **Phase**: Pending（从未进入 Running 状态）\n- **Node**: node2/10.2.0.50\n- **IP**: 172.16.104.12/32（CNI 已分配 IP，但容器未启动）\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-6584f97c76` → Deployment `workload`\n- **Container**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 -c import time; time.sleep(3600)`\n\n### 根因证据（CreateContainerConfigError）", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788423791650, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

